    "created_at": "2025-02-07T18:39:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-07T18:39:27Z",
    "body": "> After thinking about this, I think the hide popover algorithm should be using the popover's opened in popover mode instead of the current popover state.\n\nYep, I think this is the proper fix. Chromium [indeed](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_element.cc;l=1807;drc=9b045da738d6f6f5218604f66ad5c2c2ca6657a8) doesn't look at the attribute value, but instead the popover mode.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
